<title>USA: Federal Reserve business loans rose - April 2 week.</title>
<headline>Federal Reserve business loans rose - April 2 week.</headline>
<text>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED APRIL 2</p>
<p>(Seasonally adjusted, millions of dollars)</p>
<p> Business loans............800,400 down...6,100</p>
<p> U.S. Govt securities......712,700 up.....1,600</p>
<p> Large time deposits.......547,800 up.....5,500</p>
<p> U.S. commercial paper.....838,429 up ....3,976</p>
<p> Financial companies.......651,519 up.....2,557</p>
<p> New York business loans....46,121 up.......520</p>
<p> Excluding acceptances......45,847 up.......508</p>
</text>
